    "Weaknesses": [
      "The campaign might be perceived as overly commercializing cultural traditions and family moments, which could lead to negative feedback.",
      "It risks simplifying or stereotyping cultural traditions to fit the narrative around Nestlé products, potentially alienating specific groups.",
      "The success of the campaign heavily relies on the execution of the concept. If not done sensitively and authentically, it could come across as insincere.",
      "There might be a challenge in convincingly integrating Nestlé products into diverse cultural contexts without seeming forced or inauthentic."
    ]
  },
